/v1/","context":{"app_id":5000560,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5000560-1846018067928659","game_id":"steam-5000560","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.2","summary":"Hello adventurers, This is a small update aiming at fixing and improving user experience. Please see the patch notes at the bottom. What I’m working on - Improving combat foundation - Authoring more traits and skills and building the tech behind it I will share more as we get closer to the release for that. I’m expecting early or mid next week. Changes for demo 0.1.2: ImprovementsVarious improvements to UI and UX of onboarding to improve the new user experience.Bleed and Poison on monsters now s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T07:36:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928659","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000560-1845383656381847","game_id":"steam-5000560","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo luanch!","summary":"Hello adventurers, The demo for Path of the Retired Adventurer is here! What's in the demo:Crafting! Craft and master items to improve the stat rolls.Equip and send adventurers to gather more loot.Quests for you to get crafting resources and level up your adventurers.Kitchen to help with out-of-combat regen. Feed your adventurers to speed up recovery so they can head out to get more loot!Weight and supply slots. Loots and items have weights now. Do you want adventurers to bring more potions for ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T15:32:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381847","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000560-1843481262691024","game_id":"steam-5000560","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo page is live!","summary":"Hello adventurers, The demo page for Path of the Retired Adventurer is live! You can find it here: Excited to bring the demo to the public. I'm currently working on polishing the UI and refining contents for the demo. These includes: - More items to craft and equip - More affixes to roll - Updated trait and skill systems to build your adventurers Hoping to see you all soon! Cheers, Nightfeather Studio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T03:35:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691024","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000560-1840944183786122","game_id":"steam-5000560","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Path of the Retired Adventurer!","summary":"Hello adventurers, Thank you old friends and new ones for the support so far. The store page has been live for little over a week and has been growing (slowly) organically over the week. I'm currently working more marketing push and finishing the demo. What I'm working onI'm currently updating the onboarding, UI polish, and getting the early demo build ready. Based on some feedback, I'm introducing a few key systems earlier. I think it's the right call because the early game needs better hook no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T14:00:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786122","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5000560":{"las